description=Fixes/tunes Search Mode light penalties when using a flashlight. <LINE> Minimum-Light Mode OFF: active flashlights behave like vanilla B42.18+ full light, so the Darkness Effect won’t reduce your Vision Radius. <LINE> Minimum-Light Mode ON: active flashlights set a configurable minimum light instead of forcing 1.0; ambient/global lights can still raise it above that floor. <LINE> Updated to preserve tuning after the B42.18 torch-strength change and checked for B42.19.